    {
      "id": 14592,
      "title": "Crude birth and death rates, England and Wales 1541–2015",
      "description": "Our World in Data compiled the data from the following sources: for the years 1541–1861, Wrigley and Schofield (1981); for the years 1862–2003, Brian Mitchell (2010); for the years 2004–2015, the UK Office for National Statistics (2016).\n\nBrian Mitchell's series is available at [International Historical Statistics](http://www.eui.eu/Research/Library/ResearchGuides/Economics/Statistics/DataPortal/IHS.aspx#Access). The UK ONS series is available at the [ONS births, deaths and marriages portal](https://www.ons.gov.uk/peoplepopulationandcommunity/birthsdeathsandmarriages/).",
      "producer": "Wrigley and Schofield, Mitchell, and UK ONS",
      "citationFull": "Wrigley, E. A., and Schofield, R. S. (1981). The Population History of England: A Reconstruction. Cambridge University Press; Mitchell, B. R. (2010). International Historical Statistics; UK Office for National Statistics (2016). Births, deaths and marriages.",
      "urlMain": "https://www.ons.gov.uk/peoplepopulationandcommunity/birthsdeathsandmarriages/",
      "dateAccessed": "2017-06-01",
      "datePublished": "2016"
